# No API keys or environment variables are required to run the current local hub.
# The existing app stores study progress in your browser (localStorage).
#
# If a future optional external API integration is added:
#   1. Document each variable here WITHOUT a real value.
#   2. Set the real value in .env.local (ignored by Git).
#   3. Never expose private keys in client-side NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables.
#   4. Restart the development server after changing env values.
